{"id":"solange","lemma":"solange","pos":"conj","rank":557,"glosses":["while, since","provided that, assuming"],"ipa":"/zoˈlaŋə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/91/De-solange.ogg/De-solange.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Bleiben Sie, solange Sie wollen.","en":"Stay as long as you want to.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593300","words":[{"g":"to remain"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to want"}]},{"text":"Tu es, solange du noch kannst!","en":"Do it while you can.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"}]},{"text":"Sei still, solange wir essen!","en":"Be quiet while we're eating.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"quiet, silent"},null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"to eat"}]},{"text":"Solange wir leben, müssen wir arbeiten.","en":"As long as we live, we have to work.","words":[null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to work"}]},{"text":"Iss, solange es noch heiß ist!","en":"Eat it while it's hot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757644","words":[{"g":"to eat","l":"essen"},null,{"g":"it"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"hot"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]}]}